codex
The 30-anchor measurement is underway. This expands the held-out set from the initial smoke run’s single physical step to two full physical steps and gives model selection one separate step, while preserving all three carrier views within a split. The discarded-structure comparator now uses the exact sufficient network terms with a fitted OLS readout, so it measures information availability rather than k-NN distance behavior in a larger feature space.
