Final verification is complete. Commit `7cc9371` contains only the required report, diagnostic, and two tests; the fallback flag is restored to `True`, and there is no committed change to thresholds or pilot constants. The feature-collision test passes, exact-label tests pass in exact mode, and the restored proxy mode fails with the recorded assertions. The unrelated pre-existing deletion and scratch directory remain uncommitted.
